      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        185.34170532226562,
        172.31643676757812,
        409.8873291015625,
        192.5436248779297
      ],
      "text": "the recommendations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        206.72621154785156,
        89.71540069580078,
        223.58221435546875
      ],
      "text": "I",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.92539978027344,
        210.73301696777344,
        164.44459533691406,
        222.53221130371094
      ],
      "text": "ntroduction",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        231.2750244140625,
        513.4719848632812,
        244.62652587890625
      ],
      "text": "With input from the Guidelines Development Group (“the Panel”), WHO finalized a list",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        247.27154541015625,
        513.368408203125,
        260.623046875
      ],
      "text": "of recommendations that are relevant to the management of TB in children, including",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        263.26806640625,
        513.4606323242188,
        276.61956787109375
      ],
      "text": "recommendations developed since publication of the first edition of the guidance in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        279.26458740234375,
        117.00938415527344,
        292.6160888671875
      ],
      "text": "2006.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        303.77105712890625,
        513.3798828125,
        317.12255859375
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review of the literature was conducted for each topic relevant to the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        319.7675476074219,
        513.4259033203125,
        333.1190490722656
      ],
      "text": "recommendations and the evidence was synthesized and presented in a table available",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        335.7640380859375,
        168.74789428710938,
        349.11553955078125
      ],
      "text": "on WHO website",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        168.74789428710938,
        335.7640380859375,
        367.2955017089844,
        349.11553955078125
      ],
      "text": "www.who.int/tb/challenges/children/en/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        367.2955017089844,
        335.7640380859375,
        370.49249267578125,
        349.11553955078125
      ],
      "text": ".",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        360.2705383300781,
        513.3914794921875,
        373.6220397949219
      ],
      "text": "For each recommendation, any recent evidence is summarized, followed by a",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        376.26702880859375,
        513.4606323242188,
        389.6185302734375
      ],
      "text": "description of the benefits, harms and other considerations used in reviewing the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        392.2635192871094,
        513.4490966796875,
        405.6150207519531
      ],
      "text": "recommendation and its grading (see text below for definitions of the strength levels of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        408.260009765625,
        197.2908935546875,
        421.61151123046875
      ],
      "text": "the recommendation).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        432.7665100097656,
        443.7130126953125,
        446.1180114746094
      ],
      "text": "New evidence showed that the existing recommendations were still valid.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        457.27301025390625,
        513.4373168945312,
        470.62451171875
      ],
      "text": "The final decisions are listed in the Executive summary. This annex provides more detail",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        473.2695007324219,
        513.4375610351562,
        486.6210021972656
      ],
      "text": "about the evidence considered and the discussions that took place during the Panel",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        489.2659912109375,
        513.471923828125,
        502.61749267578125
      ],
      "text": "meeting in July 2012. Where evidence is weak or lacking, future research is suggested",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        505.26251220703125,
        163.00941467285156,
        518.614013671875
      ],
      "text": "(see Chapter 9).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        529.7689819335938,
        513.4028930664062,
        543.1204833984375
      ],
      "text": "In the GRADE assessment process, the quality of a body of evidence is defined as the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        545.7654418945312,
        513.4488525390625,
        559.116943359375
      ],
      "text": "level of confidence that the estimates of effect reported in the literature are the same",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        561.761962890625,
        513.4146118164062,
        575.1134643554688
      ],
      "text": "as the actual effects of the intervention being studied. The value of an estimate of the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        577.7584838867188,
        513.4603271484375,
        591.1099853515625
      ],
      "text": "effect of a given intervention depends on the level of confidence in that estimate. The",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        593.7549438476562,
        513.3685913085938,
        607.1064453125
      ],
      "text": "higher the quality of evidence, the more likely it is that a strong recommendation can",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        609.75146484375,
        513.4375,
        623.1029663085938
      ],
      "text": "be made; however, the decision regarding the strength of the recommendation also",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        625.7479858398438,
        214.77088928222656,
        639.0994873046875
      ],
      "text": "depends on other factors.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        650.2544555664062,
        513.391357421875,
        663.60595703125
      ],
      "text": "In the GRADE profiles, the following levels of assessment of the quality of evidence are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        666.2509765625,
        111.24789428710938,
        679.6024780273438
      ],
      "text": "used:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        688.4805297851562,
        513.4490356445312,
        701.9010009765625
      ],
      "text": "High Further research is very unlikely to affect confidence in the estimate of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        157.0408935546875,
        702.3494873046875,
        184.9283905029297,
        715.7009887695312
      ],
      "text": "effect",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        722.0835571289062,
        513.4490356445312,
        735.5040283203125
      ],
      "text": "Moderate Further research is likely to have an important impact on confidence in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        157.0408935546875,
        735.9525146484375,
        262.23138427734375,
        749.3040161132812
      ],
      "text": "the estimate of effect",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        755.6865234375,
        513.4144287109375,
        769.1069946289062
      ],
      "text": "Low  Further research is very likely to have an important impact on confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        157.0408935546875,
        769.5554809570312,
        490.3339538574219,
        782.906982421875
      ],
      "text": "in the estimate of effect and is likely to change the existing estimate",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939056396484,
        789.8875122070312,
        347.8373718261719,
        803.3079833984375
      ],
      "text": "Very low Any estimate of effect is very uncertain",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "91",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
